{"code": "def parse_port(text: str) -> int:
    if not text or not text.isascii():
        raise ValueError("Input must be nonempty ASCII")
    if not text.isdigit():
        raise ValueError("Input must contain only digits")
    if text == "0":
        raise ValueError("Port cannot be zero")
    value = int(text)
    if value < 1 or value > 65535:
        raise ValueError("Port out of range")
    return value", "summary": "解析端口号字符串，仅接受非空ASCII数字（1-65535），拒绝空格、符号、Unicode数字、零及越界值，允许前导零。"}
